              "type": "text",
              "text": "Alice can paint the bathroom in 3 hours and the kitchen in 5 hours. Betty can paint the bathroom in 4 hours and the kitchen in 2 hours. By working together, what is the fastest time for them to paint both the kitchen and bathroom?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p18-q11-hint-text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 1,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hint: Each painter should focus on the room they paint more efficiently.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p18-q11-short-result",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
